- Centralized in llm_gateway service (not per-tool)
- Tracks all model calls regardless of which tool/agent calls it
- Daily quota reset at midnight Pacific Time
- 429 (quota exceeded) errors trigger HITL (Human-In-The-Loop) model selection
  (NOT automatic fallback - human chooses which model to use)
- See HITL_MODEL_SELECTION_SYSTEM.md for HITL workflow
- See /hitl/available-models endpoint on llm_gateway for quota status

ROLE DESIGNATIONS (January 3, 2026):
